{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pilot your rusty-but-trusty Zero-G fighter through forsaken, procedurally generated ruins where you will question the very definition of up and down. Battle enemy attack drones, scavenge weapon mods and shields to survive the descent into this insane underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A space-ripping anomaly has torn these places apart, leaving them broken and changed yet still the same. A sentient flesh fungus born from the anomaly festers there. It infects everything, twisting it into mindless killers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332820/extras/promo_shooty_a2.gif?t=1746289393\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zero-G Combat:</strong> Intense fights in all directions, against relentless enemy hoards and vicious mercenaries </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scavenge everything:</strong> Scrounge up enemy weapons and strap on mods to rain hell down on anything that moves. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1332820/extras/promo_shooty_c2.gif?t=1746289393\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedurally generated ruins:</strong> No descent into the anomaly is the same. Face brutal challenges that shift with every dive. There is always somebody wanting a piece of you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gritty atmosphere:</strong> Enter forsaken lost places where the only thing that matters is what you can get out of there - if you make it back alive.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1332820?t=1746289393","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1332820?t=1746289393","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.st